{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Flagship&quot; is a single-player third-person space warship simulation roguelike game. From destroyers to battleships, freely choose your vessel and equip it to face node-based roguelike challenges, with each adventure offering a different experience. Your ship, equipment, skill level, and roguelike ability build will be constantly tested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/72c29218a2610b41ad736a63c5030c32.avif?t=1760987356\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras_big/72c29218a2610b41ad736a63c5030c32.avif?t=1760987356 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense and Strategic Space Combat</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.poster.avif?t=1760987356\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.webm?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.mp4?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vessel's loadout, traits, and tactical reflexes will be tested across randomized challenges. Will you prioritize shield capacity or powerful weapons? Sacrifice engine power for more turrets?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a fresh challenge where you'll unlock unique abilities, customize your warship with upgrades, and ultimately forge a mighty vessel capable of overcoming any threat. Plus, our progression system lets you permanently boost your stats - giving you an increasing edge with each new attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Space Warship Simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.poster.avif?t=1760987356\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.webm?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.mp4?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This isn't dogfighting in some tin-can starfighter \u2013 you're commanding capital-class firepower.</i>\u00a0 Unlock warship classes that redefine combat: refitted battleships enhanced with longrange railgun, or carriers that swarm enemy with drones\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warship Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.poster.avif?t=1760987356\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.webm?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.mp4?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you'll unlock more weapons and dreadnought hulls\u2013 but <i>true power lies in how you assemble them</i>. Every section you choose, every device installed in engineering bay, defines your combat signature. Will your flagship be a glass cannon bristling with spinal-mounted railguns, or an armored leviathan radiating defensive countermeasures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/997090?t=1760987356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760987356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/a933c69aa42d5bdd3593b76d8fb4a7704b5d880f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760987356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/a933c69aa42d5bdd3593b76d8fb4a7704b5d880f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760987356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Flagship&quot; is a single-player third-person space warship simulation roguelike game. From destroyers to battleships, freely choose your vessel and equip it to face node-based roguelike challenges, with each adventure offering a different experience. Your ship, equipment, skill level, and roguelike ability build will be constantly tested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/72c29218a2610b41ad736a63c5030c32.avif?t=1760987356\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras_big/72c29218a2610b41ad736a63c5030c32.avif?t=1760987356 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense and Strategic Space Combat</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.poster.avif?t=1760987356\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.webm?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/4c21f0a130000dd759679d8a173b9708.mp4?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vessel's loadout, traits, and tactical reflexes will be tested across randomized challenges. Will you prioritize shield capacity or powerful weapons? Sacrifice engine power for more turrets?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a fresh challenge where you'll unlock unique abilities, customize your warship with upgrades, and ultimately forge a mighty vessel capable of overcoming any threat. Plus, our progression system lets you permanently boost your stats - giving you an increasing edge with each new attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Space Warship Simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.poster.avif?t=1760987356\" width=544 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.webm?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/b00699c23b9aa8bf5c069496c8efc503.mp4?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This isn't dogfighting in some tin-can starfighter \u2013 you're commanding capital-class firepower.</i>\u00a0 Unlock warship classes that redefine combat: refitted battleships enhanced with longrange railgun, or carriers that swarm enemy with drones\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warship Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.poster.avif?t=1760987356\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.webm?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/extras/d65534eda2f6ca0d23f994913620b574.mp4?t=1760987356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you'll unlock more weapons and dreadnought hulls\u2013 but <i>true power lies in how you assemble them</i>. Every section you choose, every device installed in engineering bay, defines your combat signature. Will your flagship be a glass cannon bristling with spinal-mounted railguns, or an armored leviathan radiating defensive countermeasures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["NeveraiN Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/997090/20117c14e330ee7f2adbb07a89a31470dca5af51/header.jpg?t=1760987356","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/997090/1612947564/cbae26569e91b4f9b8467e6c88a435e66ac054af/1760985252/d